01:34.240 --> 01:35.780
My name is Asami.

01:35.780 --> 01:38.410
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:38.410 --> 01:41.490
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:41.490 --> 01:43.490
I'm actually married.

01:43.490 --> 01:45.660
My husband...

01:44.580 --> 01:45.660
Morning.

01:46.620 --> 01:48.120
Good morning.

01:48.120 --> 01:51.000
...Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:51.710 --> 01:54.090
I'm making breakfast right now.

02:01.930 --> 02:06.810
Our Marriage was Discovered!

02:08.140 --> 02:10.770
I still have goosebumps.

02:10.770 --> 02:13.650
It's winter, and yet there are still cockroaches around.

02:13.650 --> 02:16.900
Not much of a roach fan, are you?

02:17.240 --> 02:19.740
It's more a matter of being scared.

02:22.580 --> 02:24.330
Can I ask you something?

02:24.870 --> 02:25.700
Yes?

02:25.700 --> 02:29.040
Does Onohara-san have any siblings?

02:29.420 --> 02:30.630
Siblings?

02:30.630 --> 02:32.670
Like an older brother, for example.

02:33.380 --> 02:36.920
No, Asami's an only child.

02:36.920 --> 02:40.010
Umm... did something happen to Asami?

02:40.010 --> 02:43.640
No, it's nothing... Thanks for your time.

02:45.560 --> 02:48.430
Huh, Iwasaki-sensei did?

02:48.430 --> 02:51.440
Yeah, she asked if you had a brother.

02:51.440 --> 02:53.860
Any idea why she'd be curious?

02:53.860 --> 02:55.610
No...

02:57.780 --> 03:00.400
N-No, not really.

03:01.030 --> 03:03.700
Iwasaki-sensei must've heard from someone...

03:03.700 --> 03:06.080
...about my husband and me.

03:06.080 --> 03:11.330
After all, we pass ourselves off
as siblings in the neighborhood.

03:11.330 --> 03:14.880
What should I do if she
finds out we're married?

03:12.880 --> 03:17.420
Science Lab

03:15.460 --> 03:17.420
Ah, Iwasaki-sensei?

03:17.800 --> 03:20.470
Want to have some tea
on your way home today?

03:20.470 --> 03:24.300
Ah, no, today won't work.

03:25.180 --> 03:26.890
Ichimaru-sensei,

03:26.890 --> 03:31.140
I never knew that you had
a cute little sister.

03:31.140 --> 03:32.400
"Little sister"?

03:33.020 --> 03:34.270
Be seeing you.

03:35.270 --> 03:36.730
Little sister...

03:39.940 --> 03:42.200
C-Could it be?

03:42.860 --> 03:43.870
That's right.

03:43.870 --> 03:48.120
Someone must've told Iwasaki-sensei about Asami and me.

03:48.120 --> 03:52.080
It's going to get ugly if
she discovers our marriage!

04:00.050 --> 04:04.010
Does Iwasaki-sensei
already know we're married?

04:05.640 --> 04:08.180
Darling, please come back soon.

04:09.060 --> 04:11.640
I'm... so scared.

04:13.560 --> 04:15.400
By the way, Ichimaru-sensei...

04:15.400 --> 04:18.020
Y-Yes?

04:18.020 --> 04:20.110
It's about Onohara-san.

04:20.110 --> 04:21.530
H-Here it comes.

04:21.530 --> 04:24.360
U-Umm, who did you hear this from?

04:24.360 --> 04:26.870
Does it matter?

04:27.330 --> 04:30.620
But this is problematic, isn't it?

04:30.950 --> 04:35.420
Siblings <i>should love each other,
but not like this.</i>

04:35.420 --> 04:38.130
Eh, no, you're mistaken.

04:38.130 --> 04:39.670
About what?

04:39.670 --> 04:43.220
You're <i>not her brother?</i>

04:43.670 --> 04:45.510
W-Well, I mean...

04:45.970 --> 04:47.390
Am I right?

04:48.850 --> 04:50.680
K-Kinda...

04:51.600 --> 04:53.480
I thought so.

04:53.480 --> 04:56.650
There's no way you and Onohara-san could be brother and sister.

04:58.270 --> 04:59.320
So,

04:59.980 --> 05:02.690
since you didn't want
your love affair revealed,

05:03.030 --> 05:05.660
being siblings was your cover story.

05:05.660 --> 05:07.450
T-That's...!

05:10.370 --> 05:11.790
Am I right?

05:13.120 --> 05:14.660
I'll be right there.

05:16.250 --> 05:17.960
Still, thank goodness...

05:19.040 --> 05:22.000
...that she thinks Asami and I
are only dating.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.630
Certainly.

05:22.630 --> 05:25.470
<i>Apparently, she doesn't know we're married.</i>

05:25.470 --> 05:26.550
But...

05:27.390 --> 05:29.470
If only you two truly were siblings.

05:30.390 --> 05:33.930
You wouldn't be able to marry,
no matter how much you loved each other.

05:35.140 --> 05:37.560
We couldn't get married?
What do you know-?

05:37.560 --> 05:39.770
I mean, of <i>course we wouldn't get married.</i>

05:44.360 --> 05:46.860
P-Please enjoy your stay.

05:47.490 --> 05:50.950
Haha, us, get married? How silly...

05:53.790 --> 05:57.330
But still, you're quite daring,
Ichimaru-sensei.

05:57.670 --> 06:00.040
After all, you <i>are dating your student.</i>

06:01.290 --> 06:05.050
Then again, it's not like I'm one to talk.

06:05.840 --> 06:07.680
But...

06:09.840 --> 06:12.100
That's the Ichimaru-sensei that...

06:13.560 --> 06:15.020
...I love so much.

06:16.890 --> 06:19.850
Sorry, but I have to get going.

06:19.850 --> 06:21.150
P-Pardon me.

06:25.990 --> 06:28.240
Thank you very much.

06:28.740 --> 06:30.490
Miss!

06:31.990 --> 06:34.240
You forgot something.

06:34.870 --> 06:36.620
That's Ichimaru-sensei's.

06:42.250 --> 06:44.630
Iwasaki-sensei is nothing but trouble.

06:45.130 --> 06:47.170
I'm lucky I survived that.

06:48.220 --> 06:52.300
Ahh! M-My bag.

06:53.470 --> 06:56.720
E-Excuse me, but was there a bag here on this seat?

06:56.720 --> 07:01.100
Ah, your companion
took that home with her.

07:03.650 --> 07:05.570
Ichimaru-sensei's house?

07:06.110 --> 07:09.780
I'm Ichimaru-sensei's colleague, Iwasaki.

07:10.150 --> 07:12.160
I have important business with him.

07:16.700 --> 07:19.750
Yes! I'll be right there!

07:20.410 --> 07:25.880
A moment ago, an "Iwasaki-sensei" wanted to know where Ichimaru-sensei's house was.

07:26.210 --> 07:28.760
Eh? Iwasaki-sensei asked you that?

07:28.760 --> 07:30.880
So she's probably heading your way.

07:31.340 --> 07:34.050
I thought that I should let you-

07:33.220 --> 07:34.680
No waaay!!

07:36.470 --> 07:40.310
Iwasaki-sensei will find out that I live here.

07:44.230 --> 07:45.610
This must be it.

07:46.940 --> 07:49.320
I wonder if he's back yet.

07:50.570 --> 07:52.200
Excuse me!

07:52.740 --> 07:54.070
S-She's here!

07:54.870 --> 07:56.370
Shhh!

07:56.830 --> 07:58.660
Looks like he's out.

07:59.500 --> 08:02.500
I'll just have to wait here
until he gets back.

08:02.870 --> 08:05.210
N-No...!

08:15.140 --> 08:17.010
I-Iwasaki-sensei!

08:17.010 --> 08:18.140
Welcome back.

08:18.140 --> 08:19.640
My husband's voice!

08:20.310 --> 08:22.180
Here, you forgot this.

08:22.180 --> 08:25.190
S-Sorry to make you come all this way.

08:25.600 --> 08:28.570
Your house seems nice and calm.

08:29.110 --> 08:32.070
Good thing Asami isn't home yet.

08:32.070 --> 08:36.530
W-Well, this is awkward,
so I'll walk you back to the sta-

08:35.570 --> 08:37.620
Isn't living alone kind of sad?

08:39.290 --> 08:43.790
Haha, I'm used to it.
Don't worry about me; let's get going.

08:51.260 --> 08:55.050
I-Iwasaki-sensei!
What's the matter, Iwasaki-sensei?

08:55.050 --> 08:57.090
I-I'm having chest pains!

08:57.090 --> 09:00.470
But I should be fine, with a little rest.

09:01.640 --> 09:06.020
What should I do?
I can't just leave her like this.

09:06.020 --> 09:09.860
Argh... My chest...!

09:09.860 --> 09:12.030
Well, just for a bit.

09:12.030 --> 09:14.030
Aw, come on!

09:14.990 --> 09:16.490
Can you stand up?

09:16.490 --> 09:18.410
Not quite.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.950
Are you okay, Iwasaki-sensei?

09:23.950 --> 09:25.580
Y-Yeah...

09:25.920 --> 09:29.710
For a bachelor's pad,
this place is awfully clean.

09:31.090 --> 09:34.670
And there's even dinner on the table... for two?

09:34.670 --> 09:38.840
Umm, err, no, well, more importantly, how's your chest?

09:38.840 --> 09:40.680
It seems fine now.

09:42.310 --> 09:43.770
Moreover...

09:48.770 --> 09:51.020
Cute, flowery underwear.

09:52.230 --> 09:53.900
W-Well, this is...

09:54.570 --> 09:57.400
You lied about living by yourself.

09:57.990 --> 10:00.660
You're shacked up
with that girl, aren't you?

10:01.370 --> 10:03.200
D-Darling...

10:19.010 --> 10:22.220
Don't touch me! Go away!

10:22.220 --> 10:24.560
Darling~!!

10:25.890 --> 10:27.480
I'm so scared!

10:27.480 --> 10:30.230
Save me, Darling...

10:30.230 --> 10:32.360
A-Asami...

10:34.610 --> 10:37.110
O-Onohara-san?

10:38.610 --> 10:40.820
"Darling"?

10:40.820 --> 10:45.330
Ahh, well, that's...
it's not what it looks like!

10:46.200 --> 10:47.660
You two... were a... married couple?

10:57.720 --> 10:59.010
I...

11:02.800 --> 11:04.930
Iwasaki-sensei!

11:10.100 --> 11:12.100
Looks like the jig is up.

11:13.150 --> 11:14.570
Darling...

11:16.650 --> 11:20.360
What will become of us?

11:24.160 --> 11:25.910
My name is Asami.

11:25.910 --> 11:28.620
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

11:28.620 --> 11:32.370
I've kept it secret from everyone, but...

11:32.370 --> 11:34.460
I'm actually married.

11:34.460 --> 11:38.510
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.920
Looks like another cold one.

11:46.560 --> 11:49.060
However, a week ago...

11:49.560 --> 11:52.440
...our marriage...

11:52.440 --> 11:54.480
...was discovered.

11:56.770 --> 12:01.740
Love Me Forever And Always...

12:02.070 --> 12:05.780
The second trimester ends today,
and winter break starts tomorrow, right?

12:06.370 --> 12:08.540
Say, Darling?

12:08.950 --> 12:11.960
If word gets out about our marriage...

12:11.960 --> 12:15.250
...you'd have to leave
the school, wouldn't you?

12:15.710 --> 12:17.750
There's no need to worry.

12:17.750 --> 12:18.420
But...

12:19.090 --> 12:22.930
Even if I quit this teaching job,
I'll keep on protecting you.

12:24.130 --> 12:27.680
No matter what happens, I will make you happy.

12:35.730 --> 12:39.650
I don't want to see Asami sad, but...

12:40.110 --> 12:42.400
...it looks like I'm cornered.

12:44.360 --> 12:48.080
When the crucial moment comes,
I'll be ready for it.

12:52.290 --> 12:53.370
Good morning.

12:57.170 --> 13:01.760
Thank goodness...
Nobody's acting any differently today.

13:18.440 --> 13:20.190
Iwasaki-sensei...

13:27.240 --> 13:30.580
Even though she knows we're married,

13:30.580 --> 13:36.080
Iwasaki-sensei isn't
reacting to us in school at all.

13:39.420 --> 13:41.670
At last, it's finally over!

13:41.670 --> 13:44.050
And winter break starts tomorrow!

13:44.050 --> 13:46.720
Can you come shopping with me?

13:46.720 --> 13:49.510
I need to get a Christmas present
for my boyfriend.

13:49.510 --> 13:50.800
I...

13:50.800 --> 13:53.220
"...have to get a present
for Ichimaru-sensei."

13:53.220 --> 13:55.230
Let's go together.

13:54.560 --> 13:56.390
O-Okay.

13:56.770 --> 14:01.650
You two go on ahead.
I have to meet with my club's adviser.

14:01.650 --> 14:03.190
Catch you later!

14:06.400 --> 14:09.160
Staff Room

14:07.490 --> 14:09.160
Ah, Ichimaru-sensei?

14:09.570 --> 14:10.910
Yes?

14:11.410 --> 14:13.910
Can you come to the
Principal's office right away?

14:13.910 --> 14:16.290
There's an important matter to discuss.

14:16.290 --> 14:17.920
"Important matter"?

14:18.330 --> 14:19.500
See you there.

14:19.500 --> 14:20.920
Y-Yes, sir.

14:36.980 --> 14:39.100
Principal's Office

14:40.230 --> 14:42.110
Pardon me.

14:46.570 --> 14:48.280
Iwasaki-sensei...

14:48.280 --> 14:50.700
Actually, Ichimaru-sensei...

14:51.530 --> 14:54.030
According to Iwasaki-sensei,

14:54.030 --> 14:56.580
we have a bit of a situation here.

14:56.580 --> 14:58.500
F-Figured as much.

14:58.500 --> 15:01.170
How does this look to you?

15:01.170 --> 15:03.170
Umm, please wait.

15:03.170 --> 15:06.420
I'm ready to accept
whatever befalls me.

15:06.420 --> 15:09.510
That should simplify things.

15:09.840 --> 15:12.010
Yes, that would help us a lot.

15:12.390 --> 15:16.100
I'm prepared to take full responsibility.

15:16.100 --> 15:16.560
Huh?

15:17.600 --> 15:20.810
I'm sorry I caused you all
so much trouble.

15:20.810 --> 15:23.480
"Resignation Letter"

15:21.270 --> 15:22.350
Here.

15:23.860 --> 15:25.730
A-A resignation letter?

15:25.730 --> 15:26.980
"Resignation"?

15:29.150 --> 15:30.530
Please excuse me.

15:31.910 --> 15:33.240
Ichimaru-sensei!

15:37.290 --> 15:39.290
Staff Room

15:38.080 --> 15:39.290
Where's Ichimaru-sensei?

15:39.710 --> 15:41.830
He just left the building.

15:41.830 --> 15:43.080
Oh man...

15:43.080 --> 15:47.750
Ichimaru-sensei waltzed in and submitted his resignation out of nowhere!

15:48.380 --> 15:50.840
Ichimaru-sensei is quitting?

15:52.970 --> 15:56.180
You're so lucky, Asami.
You managed to find so many nice things.

15:56.180 --> 15:58.680
I've been eying these for a while now.

15:58.680 --> 16:02.730
Even after two hours,
I still can't make up my mind.

16:03.810 --> 16:05.150
Bad news, Asami!

16:05.150 --> 16:06.860
Ichimaru-sensei has...

16:07.270 --> 16:09.990
Eh!? Why did he quit?

16:09.990 --> 16:14.530
I don't know, but the Principal said that he submitted his resignation.

16:16.070 --> 16:18.620
Sorry, I'm going home.

16:18.620 --> 16:19.660
Asami!

16:24.670 --> 16:27.920
Worst. Christmas. Ever.

16:28.710 --> 16:32.300
When Asami hears about
me leaving school, I'm sure she'll...

16:34.590 --> 16:37.510
I don't think I can tell her
the truth for a while.

16:45.520 --> 16:47.770
I-Iwasaki-sensei?!

16:47.770 --> 16:49.730
Did you submit your resignation...

16:51.320 --> 16:53.990
...because you thought I ratted you out?

16:53.990 --> 16:56.780
Ahh, well, that's...

16:57.660 --> 17:02.450
I asked the Principal to let me off
winter break guard duty.

17:02.450 --> 17:03.910
What?

17:03.910 --> 17:09.090
I told him that I was sure
you'd fill in for me.

17:09.090 --> 17:12.710
S-So that's<i> what this was all about?</i>

17:17.510 --> 17:19.390
Which is why I'm doing this.

17:19.390 --> 17:20.890
"Resignation Letter"

17:29.060 --> 17:30.320
Iwasaki-sensei.

17:31.400 --> 17:34.820
I'm sorry for hiding this
from you all this time.

17:35.900 --> 17:39.620
I... am married to Onohara Asami.

17:40.660 --> 17:44.450
There's no one I love more than her.

17:45.370 --> 17:47.210
Darling...

17:51.130 --> 17:52.250
Asami!?

18:01.180 --> 18:06.480
Because of my position,
I couldn't tell anyone about our marriage.

18:06.480 --> 18:08.100
Naturally.

18:08.940 --> 18:13.320
I imagine anyone in your position would've done the same thing.

18:14.570 --> 18:16.990
But please, rest assured.

18:16.990 --> 18:20.700
I won't tell anybody that you're married.

18:20.700 --> 18:22.410
Iwasaki-sensei...

18:23.330 --> 18:28.080
I couldn't do anything that would sadden the one I love.

18:30.380 --> 18:36.130
Besides, it really is an honor to teach with you.

18:36.130 --> 18:37.920
Iwasaki-sensei.

18:56.360 --> 18:59.110
I thought this was the year

18:59.110 --> 19:02.910
when I could spend Christmas alone with the person I love.

19:06.580 --> 19:11.580
Ichimaru-sensei,
I hope you'll be happy with Onohara-san.

19:16.340 --> 19:17.920
Merry Christmas!

19:23.010 --> 19:24.550
This is from me.

19:24.550 --> 19:26.310
Huh?

19:24.930 --> 19:26.310
From the same shop.

19:28.850 --> 19:30.600
His and hers!

19:30.600 --> 19:32.270
I'm so happy!

19:32.270 --> 19:34.440
I really wanted this.

19:34.440 --> 19:36.650
I wanted this too.

19:36.650 --> 19:40.360
Our feelings really are in sync, aren't they?

19:42.530 --> 19:46.830
I was really happy when you told Iwasaki-sensei

19:46.830 --> 19:48.580
that we were married.

19:48.580 --> 19:49.790
Asami.

19:50.710 --> 19:51.920
Darling.

19:56.340 --> 19:59.590
I feel so blissful.

19:59.800 --> 20:02.630
So do I, Asami.

20:04.140 --> 20:06.850
Love me forever, 'kay?

20:06.850 --> 20:09.270
Forever and always.

20:12.640 --> 20:14.400
Ahh, Darling~

20:14.400 --> 20:17.320
Love me lots tonight, 'kay?

20:17.320 --> 20:18.150
Asami...

20:19.070 --> 20:22.650
We can finally consummate
this marriage, right?

20:23.450 --> 20:24.570
At last...

20:27.530 --> 20:30.410
Merry Christmas!!

20:30.410 --> 20:33.000
M-Merry Christmas...

20:33.000 --> 20:35.000
Merry Christmas.

20:41.590 --> 20:42.840
Kuri!

20:47.350 --> 20:50.600
Merry Christmas!!

20:50.600 --> 20:53.390
We're dropping in!

20:52.600 --> 20:54.520
Let's get this party started in here!

20:54.520 --> 20:56.560
Asami, beer me!

20:56.560 --> 20:58.520
We've got a drinking score to settle!

20:58.520 --> 21:00.440
Asami, what's taking so long?

21:00.110 --> 21:01.230
Hold your horses!

21:03.030 --> 21:04.200
Asami-chan.

21:04.200 --> 21:05.910
Guts! Do you have it?

21:05.910 --> 21:08.950
Take whatever you want from the fridge.

21:08.950 --> 21:10.040
Sasuke!

21:10.040 --> 21:11.290
Hey!

21:11.660 --> 21:14.750
Uryaa~ Caba-Club Monster Hold!

21:14.750 --> 21:16.670
Yeah, yeah, take him down for the count!

21:16.670 --> 21:18.790
Sakura-san! That's kinda...

21:18.000 --> 21:21.210
Mama, there's no excuse for domestic abuse!

21:21.210 --> 21:23.630
This kid gets a "sleeper" move!

21:28.220 --> 21:29.800
How pretty.

21:33.600 --> 21:35.140
Darling?

21:46.570 --> 21:50.030
Please keep loving me
till the end of time, 'kay?

21:50.030 --> 21:52.950
Forever and ever.

22:16.020 --> 22:19.520
All I am is a kitten

22:16.020 --> 22:19.520
watashi wa koneko

22:19.520 --> 22:23.440
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.520 --> 22:23.440
anata hitori dake no

22:23.440 --> 22:30.320
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.440 --> 22:30.320
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.870 --> 22:34.370
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.870 --> 22:34.370
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.370 --> 22:38.540
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.370 --> 22:38.540
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.540 --> 22:41.960
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.540 --> 22:41.960
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.960 --> 22:47.880
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.960 --> 22:47.880
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.880 --> 22:55.270
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.880 --> 22:55.270
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.270 --> 23:02.190
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.270 --> 23:02.190
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.810 --> 23:12.320
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.810 --> 23:12.320
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko
